{"story_id":88191,"updated_at":"2026-11-21T06:17:49","headline_en":"PM Modi inaugurates six-lane Nitish Setu bridge over the river Ganga","headline_hi":"प्रधानमंत्री नरेंद्र मोदी गंगा नदी पर छह-लेन वाले नीतीश सेतु पुल का उद्घाटन करेंगे","payload_en":{"story_id":88191,"headline":"PM Modi inaugurates six-lane Nitish Setu bridge over the river Ganga","counts":{"articles":6,"independent_sources":3,"outlets":6},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"interim","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Hindustan Times","Khaskhabar.com","NDTV India","PIB Hindi","PM India","The Hindu"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":88191,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-11-21T06:17:49","category":{"v":2,"primary":["india"],"secondary":["politics"],"tertiary":["government"]},"places":["bihar"],"people":["Narendra Modi","JP Setu","Mahatma Gandhi Setu","Nitish Setu","Bihar Chief Minister Nitish","River Ganga","South Bihar","Nitish Kumar"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"Prime Minister Narendra Modi will lay foundation stones for development projects worth approximately 34,470 crore rupees in Vaishali at approximately 2 PM.","ids":[155855],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"Modi will land at the Patna airport today, and will visit Bihar and Vaishali district.","ids":[155825,155832,155837],"class":"single","sources":[1,2,3,4]}],[{"text":"Modi will visit Nitish Setu in Vaishali district at approximately 1:15 PM.","ids":[155838],"class":"single","sources":[1,4]}],[{"text":"Modi will inaugurate a six-lane bridge on the River Ganga.","ids":[155833],"class":"single","sources":[3]},{"text":"On 21 November Modi will dedicate the Nitish Setu bridge on the Ganga river to the nation, built at a cost of approximately 4,280 crore rupees.","ids":[155840],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"It would reduce traffic pressure on the existing Mahatma Gandhi Setu and JP Setu.","ids":[155856],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"The Nitish Setu bridge would reduce travel time between North and South Bihar.","ids":[155857],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Modi will inaugurate infrastructure and development projects worth more than 15,600 crore rupees and lay the foundation stone for projects worth approximately 14,450 crore rupees.","ids":[155841,155843],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Today, Modi will dedicate various development projects worth approximately 34,470 crore rupees to the nation and lay foundation stones for others.","ids":[155858,155859],"class":"single","sources":[4]}],[{"text":"Modi will address a public gathering at Rajapakad.","ids":[155828],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2,4]}],[{"text":"The projects include road connectivity, energy, urban infrastructure, water resources, education, healthcare, transport, and other important sectors.","ids":[155846],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Former Bihar Chief Minister Nitish Kumar will welcome Modi at the Patna airport, and the bridge (Kachi Dargah-Six Lane Bridge) was named after Kumar as a tribute to his contributions to Bihar's turnaround, a senior JD-U leader said.","ids":[155826,155830],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"The Opposition questioned the naming of the bridge after former Kumar.","ids":[155831,155834],"class":"single","sources":[2,3]}],[{"text":"The Rashtriya Janata Dal claimed the bridge was conceived in 2015 during the Mahagathbandhan government.","ids":[155835],"class":"single","sources":[3]}],[{"text":"Nitish Setu is a six-lane bridge over the Ganga River connecting Kachhi Dargah to Bidupur.","ids":[155829],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"An extradosed cable stayed bridge has been built at a cost of approximately 4,280 crore rupees.","ids":[155861],"class":"single","sources":[4]}]],"section_keys":["news","happened","happened","happened","happened","happened","happened","say","say","say","numbers","numbers"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://www.pmindia.gov.in/hi/news_updates/%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%8D%E0%A